              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ڈھول — ḍhol — \"a drum\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شادی میں لڑکے ڈھول بجا رہے تھے۔ shādī meṅ laṛke ḍhol bajā rahe the. At the wedding the boys were playing the drum."
