              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نچانا — nachānā — \"to make (someone) dance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ڈھول نے سب مہمانوں کو نچایا۔ ḍhol ne sab mehmānoṅ ko nachāyā. The drum got all the guests dancing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے بچوں کو نچایا, us ne bachchoṅ ko nachāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نچانا (nachānā) is the causative of nāchnā, \"to dance\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit nṛtyati, \"dances\" (CDIAL 7583)."
            }
          ]
        },
